preConditionHook:
// The signal bar is the bar before the entry bar, and BarsSinceEntry() is 0 on
// the bar the entry FILLS (EL_FEATURES.md `barssinceentry`, VERIFIED: 0 on the
// fill bar, 0 while flat, restarts through a reversal). So on the fill bar the
// signal bar is bar [1]. Capturing its range here instead of re-reading
// high[ctx.BarsSinceEntry() + 1] every bar keeps the deepest subscript at 1
// rather than the length of the longest trade, which Max Bars Back would
// otherwise have to cover. While flat this re-captures every bar, which is
// harmless and is what leaves the value correct on the fill bar.
if (el_eq((double)ctx.BarsSinceEntry(), 0.0)) {
    sigRange = high[1] - low[1];
}
